<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts American Home.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts American Home.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Robert Uhl downgraded American Home Products Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- He cited the stock's price, saying his 12-month price target of $71 does not justify a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 3/4 at 61-3/4 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
